; ROO311: the A5000 is an IOC machine and takes the A1 settings. The module finds at run time whether
; the floppy controller is a 1772 or an 82C710/711, as RISC OS 3.11 ADFS did.

        GET     Version

A1              SETL    {TRUE}
FDC1772         SETL    {TRUE}
Top16Write      SETL    {TRUE}
IOMD            SETL    {FALSE}

        END
